02/17/1968
PS It's not yet active, although high-ranking officers have been insisting that we prepare for hours of extreme and tiring work. To be honest, I don't know what the project is about or why the United States Department of Defense is involved.

04/23/1968
In three days, they'll pick us up to take us to the project's laboratories. On orders from high command, they've made me disappear completely. My family thinks I'm dead, friends think I left the country, I'm no longer in any records anywhere, and they've given me a new license and identity. Apparently, they've made everyone do this. All of this is making me nervous. Why so much security?

30/04/1968
We are forbidden from storing any information about this in any way. We cannot have notes, videos, audio recordings, or images that could reveal any kind of information to the public... and frankly, I understand.
This project wasn't about "having a plan in case of war"; it was about experimenting on the brains of prisoners serving life sentences or death sentences to create a super artificial intelligence.

05/12/1968
They call it the Preservation System, but inside the rooms some people call it "the core." I asked some high-ranking officers why the psychology and neuroscience departments were merged into one team. They just said "Efficiency in decision-making"... I don't believe a word of it.

06/03/1968
The test subjects aren't told what the experiment consists of; they're told they're contributing to national security. Some resignedly believe it because they're forced to, and others genuinely do it because they want to, although afterward they all scream when they connect to the machines. We're ordered not to show any emotion when the test subjects are observing us. I find that strange.

06/21/1968
Today, AI produced its first predictive result on economic issues. It wasn't accurate, but it was extremely confident. I'm surprised it's capable of simulating personality.

08/02/1968
Some of us started calling it EVVAN. I don't know where the name came from, and there's no documentation that mentions it. It just appeared... like life on Earth.
































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































































